  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Community - Power Leasing Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to secure urgent electricity supply to the southern part of Ukraine in the shortest possible way to ensure electricity access for the population during the winter season 2024-2025. Norway will contribute, together with other donors, to finance the leasing of powerships (floating platforms equipped with power plants) that will be used to urgently address the energy deficit in the Odesa region. This solution was selected mainly because it can be implemented within 4 to 6 months, which is significantly faster than building new stationary power plants.</narrative>
  </description>
